  "title": "系统提示词问题",
  "book_id": 78815357,
  "format": "lake",
  "status": 1,
  "word_count": 298,
  "created_at": "2026-07-20T10:51:19.000Z",
  "updated_at": "2026-08-30T10:07:36.000Z",
  "published_at": "2026-07-20T11:11:14.000Z",
  "content_updated_at": "2026-07-20T11:11:14.000Z",
  "content": "<!doctype lake><meta name=\"doc-version\" content=\"1\" /><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"fixed\" /><meta name=\"typography\" content=\"classic\" /><meta name=\"paragraphSpacing\" content=\"relax\" /><h1 data-lake-id=\"Y7Fg4\" id=\"Y7Fg4\"><span data-lake-id=\"u72220638\" id=\"u72220638\">q：</span></h1><p data-lake-id=\"u99a8d3cf\" id=\"u99a8d3cf\"><span data-lake-id=\"uf6b21551\" id=\"uf6b21551\">系统提示词的六个槽位上，SlotPlanner我理解是记录DAG状态是吧，SlotTaskMem记录具体节点的结果和状态，那系统提示词会一直频繁变化，会不会导致缓存经常不命中消耗大量token？如果有这两个东西了，还需要动态运行时记忆做什么？</span></p><h1 data-lake-id=\"r6Aq3\" id=\"r6Aq3\"><span data-lake-id=\"u641f13e4\" id=\"u641f13e4\">a:</span></h1><p data-lake-id=\"u7835566f\" id=\"u7835566f\"><span data-lake-id=\"uf13b2d33\" id=\"uf13b2d33\">确实会消耗大量token，这个设计的时候没有考虑Prompt Cache，应该把固定的放前面，动态的放后面。</span></p><h3 data-lake-id=\"453f4c32\" id=\"453f4c32\"><span data-lake-id=\"ue5d12b9c\" id=\"ue5d12b9c\">有了 Planner 和 TaskMem，为什么还需要动态运行时记忆？</span></h3><p data-lake-id=\"uf4c9ab8f\" id=\"uf4c9ab8f\"><span data-lake-id=\"u86ad5314\" id=\"u86ad5314\">严格来说，</span><code data-lake-id=\"u80dede96\" id=\"u80dede96\"><span data-lake-id=\"u04fcad68\" id=\"u04fcad68\">RuntimeContext</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u86ad1508\" id=\"u86ad1508\"> 不是与这两个 Slot 并列的第三份记忆。它是“本轮上下文装配层”，Planner 和 TaskMem 是它的两个输入源。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u3019975c\" id=\"u3019975c\"><span data-lake-id=\"u7a669989\" id=\"u7a669989\">它还需要解决 Planner/TaskMem 覆盖不了的内容：</span></p><ul list=\"ub59ffd32\"><li fid=\"u00d15fd5\" data-lake-id=\"u24252d30\" id=\"u24252d30\"><span data-lake-id=\"uaca35ed9\" id=\"uaca35ed9\">用户稳定偏好：</span><code data-lake-id=\"u770d4c39\" id=\"u770d4c39\"><span data-lake-id=\"uf8a2fbc1\" id=\"uf8a2fbc1\">SlotProfile</span></code></li><li fid=\"u00d15fd5\" data-lake-id=\"u87e51e59\" id=\"u87e51e59\"><span data-lake-id=\"u0ad256c5\" id=\"u0ad256c5\">当前安全和沙箱约束：</span><code data-lake-id=\"u1e9feac8\" id=\"u1e9feac8\"><span data-lake-id=\"uf68d2357\" id=\"uf68d2357\">SlotConstraints</span></code></li><li fid=\"u00d15fd5\" data-lake-id=\"ua4875b0f\" id=\"ua4875b0f\"><span data-lake-id=\"u143edd03\" id=\"u143edd03\">可用工具、近期工具故障：</span><code data-lake-id=\"u78474db6\" id=\"u78474db6\"><span data-lake-id=\"uba11dcdf\" id=\"uba11dcdf\">SlotToolState</span></code></li><li fid=\"u00d15fd5\" data-lake-id=\"u5c86d66d\" id=\"u5c86d66d\"><span data-lake-id=\"ud1748664\" id=\"ud1748664\">与当前问题相关的跨任务记忆：</span><code data-lake-id=\"u7e4e5c2c\" id=\"u7e4e5c2c\"><span data-lake-id=\"ue7476f29\" id=\"ue7476f29\">SlotRecall</span></code></li><li fid=\"u00d15fd5\" data-lake-id=\"u1b621287\" id=\"u1b621287\"><span data-lake-id=\"u92f50a56\" id=\"u92f50a56\">根据 chat/tool/react/rag 模式决定注入哪些信息</span></li><li fid=\"u00d15fd5\" data-lake-id=\"ucd59fa0c\" id=\"ucd59fa0c\"><span data-lake-id=\"ud1d8d444\" id=\"ud1d8d444\">对所有内容做 TopK、相关性过滤和 token budget 裁剪</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id=\"u7c92e988\" id=\"u7c92e988\"><span data-lake-id=\"ua0dd435b\" id=\"ua0dd435b\">​</span><br></p>",
  "empty_unpublished": false,
  "retrieved_at": "2026-10-08T16:25:13+08:00"
}